{"book":17,"chapter":17,"rubric":"OVIRT: THE PLATFORM CORE / CHAPTER 17","slides":[{"title":"Why a manager","sub":"Chapter 17 · oVirt architecture","short":"Why","main":"Hundreds of machines on dozens of hosts need unified management.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Bricks","Fleet","Tasks","oVirt"],"captions":["So far we took the bricks one at a time: hypervisor, memory, disks, network","A company has hundreds of machines on dozens of hosts","We must keep the inventory, choose a host, repair failures, grant access","oVirt is the management layer that ties all of this together"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hypervisor, memory, disk, network","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hypervisor, memory, disk, network","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hundreds of VMs on dozens of hosts","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hypervisor, memory, disk, network","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hundreds of VMs on dozens of hosts","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"inventory · placement · repair · access","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hypervisor, memory, disk, network","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"hundreds of VMs on dozens of hosts","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"inventory · placement · repair · access","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"oVirt: unified management","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.5,18.0,28.1]}]},{"title":"History and status","sub":"Chapter 17 · oVirt architecture","short":"History","main":"From Qumranet and RHV to the community and version 4.5.7.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Qumranet","oVirt","RHV","4.5.7"],"captions":["Qumranet built KVM and a management system; Red Hat bought it in 2008","The project was opened as oVirt","Red Hat's commercial version was Red Hat Virtualization","Red Hat reportedly stopped contributing and moved to OpenShift Virtualization; the community went on: 4.5.7 came out in January 2026"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"Qumranet\n2008","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"Qumranet\n2008","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"oVirt\nproject","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"Qumranet\n2008","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"oVirt\nproject","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"RHV\nproduct","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"Qumranet\n2008","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"oVirt\nproject","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.